WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.060
These are tough times for everyone,

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:04.170
but, trust me, it's really not a good time

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.210
to be a celebrity, why?

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.870
Everyone wants a selfie, everybody.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.410
That's not good, we must
keep social distancing,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.880
so I follow specific rules.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.940
Six feet away, no touching.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:15.840
Check it out, sir!

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.029
Sir, what's your name?

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:19.880
Kevin.
Kevin.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.490
Okay, you may have a selfie with me,

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.893
but you must stay six
feet away and no touching!

00:00:25.752 --> 00:00:27.002
No, I'm good.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.050
No, no, you can have a selfie!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.650
You can have a selfie with me,

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.880
but we have to keep our distance.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:34.937
No, I'm good.

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:37.423
Do you know who I am?

00:00:38.518 --> 00:00:39.601
Not really.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.870
Tough time to be a celebrity.

